flowchart TD
    baseline[Score baseline] --> candidate[Score next candidate]
    candidate --> guards{Guards pass and recall rises?}
    guards -->|Yes| keep[Promote candidate]
    guards -->|No| discard[Retain incumbent]
    keep --> ledger[Commit checkpoint]
    discard --> ledger
    ledger --> budget{Budget exhausted?}
    budget -->|No| candidate
    budget -->|Yes| freeze[Freeze configuration]
